        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric, silk satin.\nDisplayed behind glass. \nWarp: dark blue, blue, red, yellow, green, purple and white silk.\nWeft: blue, yellow, black, pink silk.\nSelvedge: single cotton cord S-spun.\nStriped 8 shaft satin.  The patterned stripes are separated by three narrow stripes:\n[1] red ground with dark trefoil sprig alternating with 3 blue edged flowers on a leafy stem;\n[2] blue ground with what seems to be a cartouche with a flower alternating with a pair of black motifs outlined in yellow;\n[3] mauve ground with pattern from [1];\n[4] yellow ground with pattern from [1];\n[5] red ground with what looks like an upward pointing bunch of grapes and the trefoil sprig;\n[6] blue ground with pattern from [5];\n[7] as [3];\n[8] pale ground with pattern from [5];\n[9] red ground with pattern from [2];\n[10] green ground with pattern from [5];\n[11] mauve ground with pattern from [1];\n[12] yellow ground with pattern from [2]."@en ;
